{"cid": "Ugy9Yb2JMYHER8C0g4l4AaABAg", "text": "For editing PID, I find it's much faster to set up a remote control with three knobs that I can use to tune the PID values in real time. Changing the values in code and then transferring it to the mechatronics takes too much time and is frustrating so the extra hardware cost is usually money well spent.", "time": "4 years ago", "author": "@OhHeyTrevorFlowers", "channel": "UCbYHmv__AdPhV9iZtVvclhg", "votes": "33", "replies": "5", "photo": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/3yQo6d6CEOQnEc5XQGI7S-mAcyxkpRBmOOM0hyfp8ZK70A0MYDEBwWp16isz7fWclNw-9dY0DA=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "heart": true, "reply": false, "time_parsed": 1640727201.237454}
